      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Booking.com, Expedia & TripAdvisor Hotel Rate Parity & Guest Review Monitor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack daily room tariffs, OTA rate parity discrepancies, and guest review scores across Booking.com and TripAdvisor.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Booking.com Hotel Rates & Reviews Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "2b06af51-f8db-425b-abc6-c1cda169c40c",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
